<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican special forces captured cartel leader El Chapo Isidro in northern Sinaloa after a firefight that left eleven people dead, and vehicles were set ablaze on a highway. The raid sparked gunfire that interrupted a local baseball match and triggered a burst of violence linked to the Sinaloa cartel. The operation also coincided with a surge in migrant caravan movements toward the U.S. border. The conflict remains an asymmetric armed struggle between the Mexican government and drug trafficking syndicates. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1KTWlhYnRYaFpKWEVzbjVsd3BTMkttaUxERmRCTUhDQ3NvNkZaeEtybEY4SENhV2lUXzRGTUIxb2xmRTJjb05ucWo4RjFDQ2FWMi1kbkdWNTZyakhDRmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOc1NDSWdHMDlTRFJPa0txY2NMWkZBWU1SdjdNLUhCRUFrN0N1SGFPVC0yMERCWmRTd1lNTUFtU2VQb0x0REVQZGt5ODFmLVFBd0RyMVJNcUhMQkJVOFdJNWZ6ZmRXNGEyamhUNzNyX3lsMXBGUnB3VTVSd2tQaGExQjllemJna0dDNE9iVWVIdlFGRG1zeldSVEM4c096OE83RXlTQWpETjFQYzlWdXZNbmozNG05M2ZBZFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOZkJJbk5kX3ZDU3MyZnp0b3M5UXl1MUllbkpsSkY5eS00TWlwXzhtLXNMSkVNakRDM1ZUMUY0VWFjYVh3Z21DNmg0ekRjakY2TFk2WXNZd09WaVFScW13c0tINVNvNWJqNGJVUGJUbGYxSUF6UzAxdEN4dDdsWXR1eTBwWUJXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNaS0xVWM4dWpacllqX3lQTGlUbUx6YVhleldQWUVfVXg0Q3dReFphcHFUa2N1OWRhNU5SUXBuNEF0VkVpTDByVGhnVWtYdjBuNnMwTE9LRzNtWEhLWmFnSDlTYVFzak1WY1JyeHo5bnFic0thbkFsZjdQX0VOdWxIREROQWRkQVpVU2JLN1FlWk1ubklNcUdfSmlfS1kydTZhNkREODVTell0Z1dpT3BRdHpnOGFpd3BzMWl5Mml4RlQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNTGl